# ER-OVERWATCH Lane Rules

## Directory Boundaries (NEVER CROSS THESE)
- `frontend/patient-client/`: Next.js 14 App Router, Tailwind 4, TypeScript only.
- `frontend/nurse-command/`: React 19, Vite, Tailwind 4, TypeScript only.
- `backend/triage-engine/`: FastAPI, Python 3.11, Pydantic v2 only.
- `backend/scene-intel/`: Python 3.11, OpenCV, MediaPipe, OpenAI SDK only.
- `shared/`: Pydantic schemas (source of truth) and TypeScript type mirrors. Architect 3 owns schema changes.

Do NOT modify files outside your assigned app unless explicitly updating shared schemas.

## Mock First
If an API endpoint isn't ready, use hardcoded mock data matching `docs/API_endpoints.md` and `shared/types/telemetry.ts`.

## LiveKit
Memoize LiveKit hooks with `useMemo`/`useCallback` to prevent infinite re-renders.
